PaperManager

The interactive concepts feature (backend/services/concepts.py,
prompts/concept_*.txt, frontend/src/components/concepts/) is adapted from
Get It. (https://github.com/beltromatti/get-it), Copyright the Get It.
authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes: prompts rewritten for research papers; the "3d" renderer dropped;
graphs carry data instead of code; model-written animation code runs in a
sandboxed iframe instead of the page; Python backend on Neo4j.

The same concept views render concept cards in Knowledge Chat
(frontend/src/components/kchat/), where the concept pipeline also runs on
chat answers (backend/services/chat_concepts.py).

3Dmol.js (https://3dmol.csb.pitt.edu, https://github.com/3dmol/3Dmol.js),
Copyright (c) 2014, University of Pittsburgh and contributors, licensed under
the BSD 3-Clause License, is vendored unmodified in
frontend/public/vendor/3dmol/ (its licence, including the notices of the code
it incorporates, is in frontend/public/vendor/3dmol/LICENSE). It renders the
3D structure cards in Knowledge Chat.
